// 1 (default) gives every geometry shader with subgroup operations the lone-lane form on every device; 2 / 4 / 8 / 16 turn
// off the Hi-Z occlusion / small-triangle / back-face / frustum test of the culling shaders (30: compaction keeps every
// triangle; for bisecting the remaining Qualcomm holes). 32 pads written storage ranges to whole words (descriptors_build:
