    // [XC2] The translated Maxwell code assumes a warp of 32 lanes (ballot word 0, lane id 0..31): XC2's light-list / cloud / post
    // shaders do warp-aggregated appends (ballot -> popcount -> leader atomicAdd -> shuffle of the base) that overlap entries on a
    // 64 / 128-lane subgroup (Adreno 750: Qualcomm 64, Turnip 128). Chosen per device: subgroupSize 32 runs them natively, any other
    // size gives every shader with subgroup operations the lone-lane form (exact for that idiom: each lane is its own leader).
    // DM_GFX_WARP_MODE=native | lone forces one way (A/B).
