// Maxwell translation, for the stages whose interface maps 1:1. A native bundle carries the translated bundle's header, binding table,
// vertex input list and c1 bytes unchanged; only the SPIR-V differs, so everything after the read (bindless / alpha-test / warm-up /
// retype rewrites, layouts, descriptors) is the same code path. Source: <shaders>/native.xgspack (xgs_pack.py format, one optional
